# Legion Control udev rules.
#
# Intentionally empty: no udev rules are needed.
#
# * Every attribute Legion Control reads is world-readable.
# * Every change is performed by legion-control-daemon (root, sandboxed,
#   polkit-authorised). Relaxing the permissions of sysfs attributes (e.g.
#   making platform_profile or fanN_target writable by a group) would bypass
#   the daemon's validation and polkit checks, so it is deliberately not done.
#
# This file is kept as the single place where future, explicitly reviewed
# rules (e.g. hotplug notifications) would live.
